# Cloudflare API Token
# How to create: Cloudflare Dashboard > My Profile > API Tokens
# Required permissions: Zone:DNS:Edit, Zone:Dynamic Redirect:Edit
CF_API_TOKEN=your-cloudflare-api-token-here

# Cloudflare Zone ID
# How to find: Cloudflare Dashboard > Select domain > Check "Zone ID" in "API" section on right sidebar
CF_ZONE_ID=your-zone-id-here
